Subject: [PATCH 31/33] paralelo: test tool 'hoshie paralelo congelar <tick>'
 stops ticking all worlds at an exact tick and saves once (Degrau B step 2,
 only with -Dhoshiestar.paralelo.teste=true)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ELhLZzamveLVoauHRY3hDN

diff --git a/patches/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java.patch b/patches/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java.patch
